ual work","desc":"Automate follow-ups, CRM updates, and pipeline routing so your team focuses exclusively on closing.","points":["CRM + pipeline automation","Instant lead follow-up sequences","Operational efficiency at scale"]},"websites":{"name":"High-Converting Websites","tagline":"Built to generate revenue","desc":"Sites engineered for lead generation, authority and sales — not just aesthetics.","points":["Conversion-optimized architecture","SEO & AEO ready from day one","Authority that closes deals"],"priceLabel":"Starting from","price":"$10,000+"},"demo":{"title":"Hear an AI Voice Agent in action","desc":"A live example of an agent recovering a missed call and booking an appointment — start to finish.","soon":"Demo coming online soon. Request a live walkthrough on a call.","cta":"Book a live walkthrough"}},"mediaLab":{"eyebrow":"Kingdom Media Lab","title":"Content that builds demand","subtitle":"Every frame, cut and campaign is engineered to generate measurable business outcomes — not just views.","filters":{"all":"All","commercials":"Commercials","reels":"Reels","campaigns":"Campaigns"},"projects":[{"id":"fashion-brand","title":"Fashion Brand Campaign","category":"campaigns","metric":"+212%","metricLabel":"Qualified Leads","description":"Full-funnel content strategy driving qualified traffic and lead capture."},{"id":"restaurant-chain","title":"Restaurant Chain Reels","category":"reels","metric":"+38%","metricLabel":"Reservations","description":"Short-form content series generating consistent reservation uplift."},{"id":"medical-practice","title":"Medical Practice Commercial","category":"commercials","metric":"+41%","metricLabel":"New Patients","description":"Brand authority commercial driving new patient acquisition."},{"id":"tech-startup","title":"Tech Startup Launch","category":"campaigns","metric":"3.2×","metricLabel":"ROAS","description":"Launch campaign across paid and organic channels."}]},"academy":{"eyebrow":"Kingdom Academy","title":"Learn from opera